  - [GOOD\: ]{color=green}Business world Serif font (Baskerville, Book Antiqua, Bookman, Cambria, Garamond, Geneva, Georgia, Goudy, Times)
  - [BAD\:]{color=red} Monospace fonts (Courier, Menlo, Monaco, Roboto)
  - [BAD\:]{color=red}[ ]{color=green}Do not use Comic Sans, Papyrus, Impact, Dyslexic, or other casual script fonts - they are unprofessional
- Full justification of text

=== layout: one-panel

# Flexible Options

@body

- Reference format does not matter
  - Biology uses Medline format as long as I can connect to your source, webpage such as doi links or https\:// are best
- Line spacing
  - 1.15 of 1.5 look best to me, but I don't care what you use as long as it look nice
  - It is nice to have some extra space after paragraphs to help set them apart.

