# AI Policy

@top

![AI Forklift in the Gym](assets/ai_forklift.png)

@bottom

- FYI\: If you rely on AI without including your own ideas, it will make for a very dull read.
- The lack of specifics and original thoughts will be painfully obvious, and if you do this, do not expect a passing grade.
